{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rejoice, liberty is here!</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516760/extras/DLC6_FREE.gif?t=1748574316\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This free DLC adds \u201cMechaJURAS\u201d, an original character from GigaBash to the game, featuring a unique moveset utilizing its massive Rocket Drill to decimate Titans, and a Grapple Claw to grab foes from afar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After numerous failed prototypes, the top minds at the Global Titan Defense Initiative have perfected the ultimate Titan deterrent. The MechaJURAS program has finally come to fruition! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516760/extras/DLC6_MJ.gif?t=1748574316\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhancements from Prototype 3.0 include improved mobility with new boosters to quickly maneuver the battlefield, increased RPM of the Rocket Drill for a powerful new finisher, and an upgraded Grapple Claw to ensure no foe can escape its grasp. Equipped with such a formidable arsenal, MechaJURAS packs all the firepower needed to take on Titans of any size!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to pilot this hulking mech, protect mankind, and dispense justice in the name of liberty!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3516760?t=1748574316","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3516760?t=1748574316","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516760/ea24beb05ca7415b23dfae6cfa76f6ab18b1c500/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748574316","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516760/ea24beb05ca7415b23dfae6cfa76f6ab18b1c500/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748574316","categorie